    "created_at": "2019-11-18T16:01:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-11-18T16:01:39Z",
    "body": "I don't think this is related to the toolchain. Init script contains call to starship executable using windows path, it seems zsh in msys2 is not happy with those path.\r\n\r\nInstead of `eval \"$(starship init zsh)\"` I added the following to my zshrc:\r\n```\r\nsource <(starship init zsh --print-full-init | sed 's#C:\\\\scoop\\\\apps\\\\starship\\\\current\\\\starship.exe#/c/scoop/apps/starship/current/starship.exe#')\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt works like a breeze.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
